# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# UrbanSafai — Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file as .env and fill in the values.
# On Hostinger: set these in the Environment Variables panel.
#
# ⚠️  DO NOT wrap values in quotes!  Example:
#     CORRECT:   DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/db
#     WRONG:     DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/db"
#
# FIRST-TIME DEPLOYMENT STEPS:
# 1. Create a Supabase project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Database → Settings (gear) → Database → Connection string → URI tab
# 3. Use the Pooler endpoints (IPv4 compatible) for Hostinger:
#    - DATABASE_URL: Transaction mode pooler (port 6543) — add ?pgbouncer=true
#    - DIRECT_URL:  Session mode pooler (port 5432)
#    Username format: postgres.[project-ref]
# 4. Set all variables below in Hostinger env vars
# 5. Deploy / restart the app
# 6. Visit /api/setup to create tables
# 7. Visit /api/health to verify everything is set
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Database (Supabase / PostgreSQL) ─────────────────────────────────
# ⚠️  NO QUOTES around the URL!
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.[project-ref]:[password]@aws-0-ap-south-1.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres?pgbouncer=true
DIRECT_URL=postgresql://postgres.[project-ref]:[password]@aws-0-ap-south-1.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres

# ─── NextAuth (Admin Login) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=your-nextauth-secret-here
NEXTAUTH_URL=https://urbansafai.in

# ─── Admin Credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@urbansafai.in
ADMIN_PASSWORD=your-admin-password-here

# ─── Email (Resend) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get your key at https://resend.com/api-keys
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your-resend-api-key-here

# ─── Server (optional, defaults shown) ─────────────────────────────────
# PORT=3000
# HOSTNAME=0.0.0.0
